},{"w":"“First","s":334.98,"e":335.62,"line":82},{"w":"time?”","s":335.62,"e":336.26,"line":82}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.96,"text":"GRAYS — LAST CALL AT THE HUB"},{"s":3.96,"e":8.88,"text":"Attention, travelers: all departures are arriving."},{"s":8.88,"e":11.54,"text":"Gate Zero has never opened."},{"s":11.54,"e":15.28,"text":"“Sit down. I already lived your life.”"},{"s":15.28,"e":19.51,"text":"Black glass bar where the black holes bend,"},{"s":19.51,"e":24.13,"text":"Gray in a clean-cut coat with a century's grin."},{"s":24.13,"e":28.37,"text":"No bodyguards, no crown, no celestial hype,"},{"s":28.37,"e":33.09,"text":"Just a drink and a deck full of alternate lives."},{"s":33.09,"e":38.11,"text":"He said, “That scar? Yeah, I know where you got it."},{"s":38.11,"e":43.72,"text":"That door you never opened? I remember what's beyond it.”"},{"s":43.72,"e":49.33,"text":"I said, “You been watching?” He said, “No, I've been you."},{"s":49.33,"e":54.35,"text":"Every road that you ran, every rain that you knew.”"},{"s":54.35,"e":58.29,"text":"Old soul, cold flow, no need to pretend,"},{"s":58.29,"e":63.21,"text":"Played the beginning so long he could hum the end."},{"s":63.21,"e":68.33,"text":"Galactic gatekeepers? Nah, that's a human-made name."},{"s":68.33,"e":74.04,"text":"Just some ruthless old thinkers who got bored of the game."},{"s":74.04,"e":76.8,"text":"If you've held every answer,"},{"s":76.8,"e":79.55,"text":"If you've walked every road,"},{"s":79.55,"e":82.11,"text":"Why are your hands shaking"},{"s":82.11,"e":85.16,"text":"When the departure board glows?"},{"s":85.16,"e":88.8,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! LAST CALL AT THE HUB!"},{"s":88.8,"e":93.73,"text":"Seen my whole life twice and they still showed up."},{"s":93.73,"e":97.47,"text":"NO HALOS! NO HORNS! NO DEBTS TO REPAY!"},{"s":97.47,"e":100.42,"text":"They've been through tomorrow—"},{"s":100.42,"e":102.58,"text":"TILL TOMORROW CHANGED."},{"s":102.58,"e":106.52,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! BLACK SUITS IN THE HAZE!"},{"s":106.52,"e":111.44,"text":"Got a billion years behind those unblinking faces."},{"s":111.44,"e":115.87,"text":"Don't tell me the ending; don't take it away."},{"s":115.87,"e":118.83,"text":"They've been through tomorrow—"},{"s":118.83,"e":120.99,"text":"TILL TOMORROW CHANGED."},{"s":120.99,"e":125.62,"text":"Concourse thirteen, clock's running in reverse,"},{"s":125.62,"e":130.14,"text":"A Gray shot pool with the moons of a universe."},{"s":130.14,"e":134.67,"text":"Another one laughed like he knew my next line;"},{"s":134.67,"e":139.89,"text":"Said, “You said it before, in a much worse timeline.”"},{"s":139.89,"e":144.22,"text":"No good guys, bad guys, no gods in disguise,"},{"s":144.22,"e":148.55,"text":"Just impossible minds with impossible lives."},{"s":148.55,"e":153.18,"text":"Some gamble with galaxies, some sit and grieve,"},{"s":153.18,"e":158,"text":"Some know when to speak; some know when to leave."},{"s":158,"e":162.53,"text":"I said, “Why come back if you've seen it all?”"},{"s":162.53,"e":168.34,"text":"He said, “Same reason you answer when an old friend calls.”"},{"s":168.34,"e":173.85,"text":"“Did you live through the loss?” “Every miserable year.”"},{"s":173.85,"e":179.56,"text":"“Did you feel what I felt?” “Why you think that I'm here?”"},{"s":179.56,"e":184.18,"text":"Not a sermon, not mercy, not some grand design;"},{"s":184.18,"e":189.79,"text":"Just the strangest kind of kinship past the edge of time."},{"s":189.79,"e":193.04,"text":"“Then tell me what happens next.”"},{"s":193.04,"e":194.03,"text":"“I can't.”"},{"s":194.03,"e":197.67,"text":"“You said you already lived my life.”"},{"s":197.67,"e":200.62,"text":"“Every version we could find.”"},{"s":200.62,"e":203.67,"text":"GATE ZERO. DESTINATION UNKNOWN."},{"s":203.67,"e":206.43,"text":"Hallelujah for the question,"},{"s":206.43,"e":209.09,"text":"Not the answer on the wall."},{"s":209.09,"e":211.74,"text":"For the moment no one owns,"},{"s":211.74,"e":214.4,"text":"For the door beyond it all."},{"s":214.4,"e":217.85,"text":"If the stars have seen our stories,"},{"s":217.85,"e":220.9,"text":"If the oldest minds still ache,"},{"s":220.9,"e":224.05,"text":"Then the holiest thing in heaven"},{"s":224.05,"e":227.3,"text":"Might be one choice left to make."},{"s":227.3,"e":232.12,"text":"Every screen blacked out, every Gray stood still,"},{"s":232.12,"e":237.04,"text":"All the engines went quiet on the outside of will."},{"s":237.04,"e":241.86,"text":"Ten trillion old lives and a lifetime of schemes,"},{"s":241.86,"e":247.57,"text":"Not a single one remembered what was coming on the screen."},{"s":247.57,"e":252.3,"text":"I looked at the Gray, said, “So you don't know?”"},{"s":252.3,"e":257.12,"text":"He laughed like a kid at the edge of the unknown."},{"s":257.12,"e":262.24,"text":"First time scared, first time free, first time late,"},{"s":262.24,"e":266.87,"text":"First time the future wouldn't fit inside fate."},{"s":266.87,"e":272.08,"text":"He said, “We crossed every cosmos looking for a sign,"},{"s":272.08,"e":278.19,"text":"But the one thing we couldn't find was a moment not designed.”"},{"s":278.19,"e":282.81,"text":"No throne in the terminal, no savior to praise,"},{"s":282.81,"e":287.14,"text":"Just a room full of veterans finally amazed."},{"s":287.14,"e":291.28,"text":"I said, “What now?” He adjusted his frame:"},{"s":291.28,"e":295.8,"text":"“Live it. For once. Without knowing the game.”"},{"s":295.8,"e":299.45,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! LAST CALL AT THE HUB!"},{"s":299.45,"e":304.37,"text":"Seen my whole life twice and they still showed up."},{"s":304.37,"e":308.11,"text":"NO HALOS! NO HORNS! NO DEBTS TO REPAY!"},{"s":308.11,"e":311.06,"text":"They've been through tomorrow—"},{"s":311.06,"e":313.23,"text":"TILL TOMORROW CHANGED."},{"s":313.23,"e":316.87,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! ALL EYES ON THE GATE!"},{"s":316.87,"e":321.5,"text":"The oldest souls alive got nothing left to say."},{"s":321.5,"e":325.92,"text":"Don't tell me the ending; don't take it away!"},{"s":325.92,"e":328.88,"text":"For the first time in forever,"},{"s":328.88,"e":331.04,"text":"WE DON'T KNOW THE WAY!"},{"s":331.04,"e":334.98,"text":"Now boarding: the life no one has lived."},{"s":334.98,"e":336.26,"text":"“First time?”"}],"duration":336.76,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}